Overview
Vipto respects your privacy and provides users with the option to request deletion of their Vipto account and associated personal data.

If you would like to delete your account, please contact us using the email address provided below.

How to Request Account Deletion
Send an email to:

vipto.app@gmail.com

Please include:

Your name registered with Vipto

The phone number associated with your Vipto account

A clear request to delete your Vipto account and associated data

Suggested Email Subject
Vipto Account Deletion Request

What Will Be Deleted
Upon receiving and verifying a valid account deletion request, Vipto will delete the personal information associated with the account, subject to any information that must be retained to comply with applicable legal, security, or regulatory requirements.

This may include information such as:

Name

Phone number

Account/profile information

User-associated requests and activity data, where applicable

Data Retention
Certain information may be retained for a limited period when required for legal, security, fraud-prevention, dispute-resolution, or other legitimate purposes. Any retained information will be handled in accordance with applicable privacy requirements.

Verification
For security purposes, Vipto may request sufficient information to verify that the deletion request is associated with the account owner before processing the request.

Contact
For account deletion or privacy-related requests, contact:

Email: vipto.app@gmail.com

App: Vipto

We will process valid account deletion requests within a reasonable period after verification.

